      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Abhishek,\n\nThe `cbi_get_common_control(\u0026ctrl)` will return non-zero if the `common_control` field is unset, which is not match the `TEST\u003dConfirm cros_ec_ucsi runs successfully with CBI bit unset`\n\nIt has to set the `COMMON_CONTROL` to 0 to enable the PPM but set to 0 is not equal to `unset`.\n\n`cbi remove 11` can set  the `COMMON_CONTROL` to `unset`.\n\n```\n24-06-27 06:28:07.358 ec:\u003e cbi\n24-06-27 06:28:08.648 [258.852600 CBI Reading board info]\n24-06-27 06:28:08.651 CBI_VERSION: 0x0000\n24-06-27 06:28:08.653 TOTAL_SIZE: 29\n24-06-27 06:28:08.661 BOARD_VERSION: 0 (0x0)\n24-06-27 06:28:08.661 OEM_ID: (Error 1)\n24-06-27 06:28:08.661 MODEL_ID: (Error 1)\n24-06-27 06:28:08.661 SKU_ID: 65538 (0x10002)\n24-06-27 06:28:08.662 FW_CONFIG: 1365 (0x555)\n24-06-27 06:28:08.664 PCB_SUPPLIER: (Error 1)\n24-06-27 06:28:08.666 SSFC: 0 (0x0)\n24-06-27 06:28:08.668 REWORK_ID: (Error 1)\n24-06-27 06:28:08.670 COMMON_CONTROL: (Error 1)   --\u003e default unset\n```",
